OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry to start
OL,6,Fwith some evening sunshine, then clear
OL,7,Fspells. Cloud and outbreaks of rain
OL,8,Fspread east overnight, rain
OL,9,Foccasionally heavy towards morning.
OL,10,FLight winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA cloudy morning with
OL,13,Foccasionally heavy rain spreading
OL,14,Fnortheast. Some brighter spells
OL,15,Fdeveloping in the afternoon along with
OL,16,Fa few heavy showers. Becoming quite
OL,17,Fbreezy in the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
