OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of rain on Wednesday,
OL,7,Fturning drier from the west later.
OL,8,FBright spells and scattered showers on
OL,9,FThursday and Friday.
